        },
        {
            type: "Peach",
            name: "Vallegrande",
            category: "Low-desert peach varieties",
            description: "This is an excellent quality, semi-freestone, yellow-fleshed peach. Flesh is firm and ripens to 60% blush at maturity. Flesh becomes red as fruit matures. Chilling requirement of 100-200 hours. Self-fruitful. Ripens early May"
        },
