            type: "Euro Pear",
            name: "Kieffer",
            category: "Low-desert pear varieties",
            description: "Medium to large late season fruit. Canning/cooking. Sprightly flavor, coarse texture. Resists fireblight, tolerates hot climates. Dependable crops. 350 hours. Self-fruitful"
