            name: "Pineapple Quince",
            category: "Low-desert quince varieties",
            description: "Heavy crops of large, tart fruit used in baking, jams, and jellies. Profuse, ornamental bloom. Cold hardy, yet low chilling requirement of 300 hours. Self-fruitful"
